---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="About" description={`${SITE.name}: ${SITE.role} in ${SITE.place}, originally from Brazil.`}>
  <section class="post-head wrap">
    <p class="kicker">About</p>
    <h1>I use code to <span class="accent">explain data</span></h1>
  </section>
  <div class="prose wrap">
    <p>
      I am a full-stack software engineer and data analyst in the Toronto area, originally from Brazil.
      I build data pipelines that download public data, check it against an independent source and turn it into
      short animated stories.
    </p>
    <p>
      On this site, I write about AI news and AI tips for people who want to use these tools at work.
      Every post cites its sources, and every number comes from an official dataset or the company's own documentation.
    </p>
    <h2>How I work</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Rigour:</strong> official sources, numbers checked against a second source, caveats stated.</li>
      <li><strong>Engineering:</strong> reproducible pipelines with automated checks.</li>
      <li><strong>Clarity:</strong> one idea per post, in plain English.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Find me on <a href={SITE.links.github}>GitHub</a> and <a href={SITE.links.instagram}>Instagram</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
